            "# Episodes": 13,
            "Episodes": {
                "1": {
                    "ID": "9795436",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/medalist/episodes/9795436",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "A Genius on the Ice",
                        "jpn": "氷上の天才"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "When former figure skater Tsukasa Akeuraji meets a self-taught skater, Inori Yuitsuka, he tries to persuade her to join a formal ice skating club. Unfortunately, Inori's mother wants her clumsy daughter to give up skating altogether.",
                        "jpn": "元フィギュアスケート選手の明浦路司は、スケートを独学で学ぶ少女・結束いのりと出会う。\r\n司はいのりに正式なクラブへ入ることを薦めるが、彼女の母親は不器用な娘にスケートを諦めさせることを望んでいた……。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "2": {
                    "ID": "10849822",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/medalist/episodes/10849822",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Prelim Badge Test",
                        "jpn": "初級バッジテスト"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Tsukasa and Hitomi encourage Inori to take the Badge Test, a certification exam for figure skating which will allow Inori to qualify for competitions. On the day of the test, Inori meets a beautiful girl who looks like a princess.",
                        "jpn": "司と瞳はいのりに、フィギュアスケートの検定試験「バッジテスト」を受けるよう勧める。\r\nそれは大会の出場資格になる級位を得るための大事なテストだった。\r\nテスト当日、いのりは会場でお姫様のような姿の美少女と出会う。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "3": {
                    "ID": "10849823",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/medalist/episodes/10849823",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Taiyaki and Cake",
                        "jpn": "たい焼きとケーキ"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Tsukasa decides to enter Inori into the Meikoh Cup to build up her record of success. When Inori feels shy dancing in front of others, Tsukasa gets her to dance in his shadow to conquer her nerves. During skating practice, Inori also meets a girl named Miké at the rink.",
                        "jpn": "実績を積むために名港杯への出場を決めたいのりと司。\r\n踊りが下手だと恥ずかしがるいのりのため、司は一緒に滑って手本を見せる。\r\nある日の練習中、いのりはリンクで「ミケ」と呼ばれる少女・三家田涼佳と出会う。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "4": {
                    "ID": "10849824",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/medalist/episodes/10849824",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Meikoh Cup, Junior Women's Prelim Free Skating (Part One)",
                        "jpn": "名港杯 初級女子FS（前）"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Inori's first competition, the Meikoh cup, begins. Inori's future is at stake, and while she gets off to a rocky start, her mother and sister are there to support her from the sidelines.",
                        "jpn": "いのりと司の初めての試合・名港杯が開幕した。\r\n娘がスケートをすることに反対だった母や、憧れの姉も見守る中、\r\nいのりはリンクでの直前練習で氷にブレードを引っ掛けて転び、\r\nジャンプも失敗してしまう。\r\nスケートを続けられるかどうか、未来を懸けた初滑走がはじまる。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "5": {
                    "ID": "10849825",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/medalist/episodes/10849825",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Meikoh Cup, Junior Women's Prelim Free Skating (Part Two)",
                        "jpn": "名港杯 初級女子FS（後）"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Inori came in top in the first round of the Prelims, whereas Miké was the last one to secure a spot. Determined to turn things around, Miké decides to try and pull off a double rotation combination that no one at the Prelims has done before.",
                        "jpn": "暫定で初級の第1位となったいのり。\r\n最終滑走者のミケは逆転を狙い、初級では誰も跳んでいない\r\n2回転のコンビネーションに挑む。\r\n抜群のリズム感と身体能力を持つミケの演技に、\r\nコーチの鞠緒も自信を持っていたが……。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "6": {
                    "ID": "10849826",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/medalist/episodes/10849826",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "The Night of the First Competition",
                        "jpn": "初戦の夜"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Hikaru is one of the best performers of Inori’s generation, and Inori is eager to catch up. However, she worries about how far behind she is in terms of her skill level compared to others her age. Tsukasa suggests Inori compete in a competition immediately after passing the level one badge test.",
                        "jpn": "同世代ではトップクラスの光の演技を見て、少しでも早く\r\n近づきたい気持ちを募らせるいのり。\r\n司はバッジテスト1級取得後すぐの大会出場を提案し、年齢的な遅れを\r\n気にするいのりに、自らが歩んできた道を語り出す……。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "7": {
                    "ID": "10849827",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/medalist/episodes/10849827",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Level One Badge Test",
                        "jpn": "1級バッジテスト"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Inori faces the level one badge test, setting her next step of competing in a championship. A successful double jump will be essential for a high score.",
                        "jpn": "西日本小中学生大会での優勝を、次の目標に定めたいのりと司。\r\nそこで高得点を得るには、2回転ジャンプの成功が必須ということもあり、\r\n司はいのりのためにできる最大限のことをしようと決意。\r\nそして、1級バッジテストの日を迎えるのだった。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "8": {
                    "ID": "10849828",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/medalist/episodes/10849828",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Western Powerhouses (Part One)",
                        "jpn": "西の強豪（前）"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "On the way to a competition, Inori leaves her skates on a train by accident. Tsukasa goes on a mad hunt for the skates ten stations away.",
                        "jpn": "大会会場へ来る途中、スケート靴が入ったバッグを\r\n電車に置き忘れてしまったいのり。\r\n司は忘れ物として届けられていたバッグを引き取るために、\r\n10駅離れた保管先へダッシュで向かう。\r\nいのりは司を信じて待つことに……。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "9": {
                    "ID": "10849829",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/medalist/episodes/10849829",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Western Powerhouses (Part Two)",
                        "jpn": "西の強豪（後）"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "After a smooth start, Inori decides to take each jump carefully, one by one. She controls her center of gravity and maintains a high speed, and Tsukasa cannot hide his excitement as she continues with her flawless performance.",
                        "jpn": "順調な滑り出しから、ひとつずつのジャンプを丁寧に決めていくいのり。\r\n重心をコントロールして速いスピードを保ち、ノーミスで演技を続ける姿に司は興奮を隠せない。\r\nはたして、いのりは西日本大会を優勝することができるのか――！"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "10": {
                    "ID": "10849830",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/medalist/episodes/10849830",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Howling at Night",
                        "jpn": "夜に吠える"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Inori competes in her second Meikoh cup, but she will need to perfect the extremely difficult double Axel if she is to progress to the next level. Meanwhile, Tsukasa is asked by Olympic silver medalist Shinichiro Sonidori to mentor his son, Rioh.",
                        "jpn": "2回目の名港杯に出場し、5級クラスで優勝するいのり。\r\nだが、次の6級昇格には、難易度が高いダブルアクセルという大きな壁があった。\r\n一方、司は五輪銀メダリスト・鴗鳥慎一郎の頼みで、彼の息子・理凰を指導することになる。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "11": {
                    "ID": "10849831",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/medalist/episodes/10849831",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Dance the Night",
                        "jpn": "夜を踊れ"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "The Lux Higashiyama FSC summer training camp begins, and Inori plans to perfect her double Axel. Meanwhile, Tsukasa offers to help Rioh, but Rioh turns him down.",
                        "jpn": "ルクス東山FSCの夏合宿が始まり、いのりはダブルアクセルの完成を目標に定めた。\r\n一方、司は目標達成シートを白紙で提出した理凰に練習のサポートを提案するが、理凰は司にシングルの選手としての実績がないことを理由に拒絶する。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "12": {
                    "ID": "10849832",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/medalist/episodes/10849832",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Shirone's Lesson",
                        "jpn": "白猫のレッスン"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Tsukasa learns of the anguish Rioh has been carrying, and dances Rioh's program on the rink. Rioh is surprised to see that Tsukasa's skating is much more skillful than he expected.",
                        "jpn": "理凰が抱えてきた苦悩を知った司は、リンクで理凰のプログラムを踊ってみせる。\r\n予想以上の巧さに驚いた理凰は、司のスケーティングが夜鷹純そっくりだと気づく。\r\n翌朝、理凰は誰よりも早く合宿所にやってきた司に近づき…。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "13": {
                    "ID": "10849833",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/medalist/episodes/10849833",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Morning Arrives",
                        "jpn": "朝が来る"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "The day of the Level Six Badge Test has finally arrived. The venue is the memorable place where Inori first met Hikaru. When Hikaru suddenly appears, she promises to meet Inori again at the All-Japans.",
                        "jpn": "6級バッジテストの会場は、いのりが初めてバッジテストを受けて、光と出会った思い出の場所だった。\r\nそこへ突然現れた光は、全日本での再会をいのりと約束する。\r\nそして、6級の基準となる3つのテストが始まった――。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                }
            }
        },
